flowchart TD
    Client((Client App))
    Gateway[API Gateway]
    Auth[Auth Service]
    Users[User Service]
    Orders[Order Service]
    Payments[Payment Service]
    Inventory[Inventory Service]
    Notify[Notification Service]
    UserDB[(User Database)]
    OrderDB[(Order Database)]
    Stripe[Stripe API]

    Client -->|HTTPS request| Gateway
    Gateway -->|authenticate| Auth
    Gateway -->|route user request| Users
    Gateway -->|route order request| Orders
    Auth -->|verify credentials| UserDB
    Users -->|read/write profile| UserDB
    Orders -->|persist order| OrderDB
    Orders -->|check stock| Inventory
    Orders -->|charge customer| Payments
    Payments -->|process payment| Stripe
    Orders -->|send confirmation| Notify
